The design system's variable fonts, self-hosted by both sites.

Every family here is licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1
(https://openfontlicense.org):

- Hanken Grotesk (HankenGrotesk-Variable.woff2, HankenGrotesk-Variable-Italic.woff2):
  SIL Open Font License 1.1.
- Plus Jakarta Sans (PlusJakartaSans-Variable.woff2):
  SIL Open Font License 1.1.
- Newsreader (Newsreader-Variable.woff2, Newsreader-Variable-Italic.woff2):
  SIL Open Font License 1.1.
- JetBrains Mono (JetBrainsMono-Variable.woff2):
  SIL Open Font License 1.1.

The licence lets the fonts be used, embedded and redistributed with the sites,
as long as they are not sold on their own and keep their names and notices.
